WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.073
Unit eight. The Heart and Blood!

2
00:00:04.035 --> 00:00:07.860
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.487
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.537 --> 00:00:15.515
Today we learn about The Heart and Blood. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.228 --> 00:00:19.361
Heart. Say it with me. Heart!

6
00:00:22.862 --> 00:00:26.245
Blood. Say it with me. Blood!

7
00:00:29.754 --> 00:00:33.120
Pulse. Say it with me. Pulse!

8
00:00:36.617 --> 00:00:40.451
Oxygen. Say it with me. Oxygen!

9
00:00:43.935 --> 00:00:47.418
Vessel. Say it with me. Vessel!

10
00:00:50.906 --> 00:00:54.139
Pump. Say it with me. Pump!

11
00:00:57.665 --> 00:01:01.498
Exercise. Say it with me. Exercise!

12
00:01:05.001 --> 00:01:08.401
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:21.742
My heart is a muscle that pumps blood through every vessel in my body. Blood carries oxygen to my cells. I can feel my pulse on my wrist, and exercise keeps my heart healthy.

14
00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:22.954
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.296 --> 00:01:29.476
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.526 --> 00:01:30.676
Pulse!

17
00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:36.779
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:37.979
Exercise!

19
00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:43.657
Did you know? Your heart beats about 100,000 times every day!

20
00:01:43.707 --> 00:01:46.020
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.385 --> 00:01:54.500
Think and answer. Where can you feel your pulse?

22
00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.700
Great answer!

23
00:01:56.818 --> 00:02:01.765
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:01.815 --> 00:02:04.460
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

